# Headers first, held data delivered later (in order and child first: prev-blk-not-found), a
# raw block, ACTIVATE and an unadmitted spork.
extend main 2 headers
extend main 2 headers hold
deliver b1
raw 00
activate
spork off
spork on
extend main 1
mutate bits_minus
extend main 1 headers
extend main 2 hold
deliver b2 rev
deliver b2
